          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পুষ্টি (pushṭi) is a tatsama, Sanskrit puṣṭi, \"a well-nourished condition, growth, thriving\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
