          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঝরানো (jhôrāno) is the causative of ঝরা, to fall away, which CDIAL lists for Bengali under a reconstructed form (CDIAL 5346): to make something fall away."
